<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.24 PCT TO 150.79.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.24 PCT TO 150.79.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index inched up 0.24 percent to 150.79 on Tuesday, Rietumu Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
